 "_about": "Source images for the site's heroes and About photo. Generators copy them byte-identically into docs/assets/img/ (scripts/design_system.py emit_assets). One photograph per page (wave r3, 2026-11-10: design_system.PAGE_HEROES). Hero crops are 16:9 cuts of the original (ESA/Webb Large JPEG or NASA full-size image; crop_16x9 = the box in the original's pixels) and phones get a 9:16 cut of their own (crop_9x16); widths = the files published per key (never wider than the cut: no upscaling; dense star fields publish fewer widths to stay inside the size budgets). Re-encoded without metadata. 'credit' is the source page's credit line verbatim; every page that shows one prints title, 'cropped', credit and licence (with its link when the licence has one) in the hero and the footer (ds_gate R3). NASA media (earth_night) is public domain; its credit is still shown. The photo is the site author's own portrait (EXIF-free copies only).",
